  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports quality root-cause analysis and CAPA tracking at QualityFirst. Stakeholders: Quality Engineers and CAPA owners (event triage, root-cause patterns, closure status), VP Quality (PPM trends, audit findings, complaint volume), and CFO (COPQ as % of revenue, warranty/recall risk exposure).\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Defect PPM = AVG(defect_ppm); Six Sigma target 3.4 PPM, world-class <100 PPM.\n- COPQ = SUM(copq_usd) and SUM(cost_impact_usd); leaders <2% of revenue, typical 5–10%.\n- First-pass yield = AVG(first_pass_yield_pct); world-class ≥99%.\n- CAPA closure rate = AVG(capa_closure_rate_pct); target ≥90% within SLA.\n- Critical events = COUNT where severity = 'Critical'; track open vs closed.\n- Customer complaints = SUM(customer_complaints); rolling trend signals systemic issues.\n- Audit findings = SUM(audit_findings); compliance and recurrence indicator.\n- Units affected = SUM(units_affected); recall-scope and warranty-cost driver.\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - quality_events_metrics (source: quality_events) — dims: event_date, product_category, defect_type, root_cause, severity; measures: total_events, total_cost_impact, total_units_affected, critical_event_count, open_quality_event_count.\n  - quality_kpi_metrics (source: quality_kpi_monthly) — dims: kpi_month, product_category; measures: avg_defect_ppm, total_copq, avg_capa_closure, avg_fpy, total_customer_complaints, total_audit_findings.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. product_line, capa_status, inspection_type, result, inspector_id).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "What is the monthly trend in defect PPM by product category over the trailing 12 months?",
    "Top 10 root causes by total cost impact in the last quarter.",
    "Which product lines have the most open Critical quality events right now?",
    "Rank product categories by CAPA closure rate — which are below the 90% target?",
    "Show monthly trend in Cost of Poor Quality vs customer complaints.",
    "Top 10 defect types by units affected this year, and which root cause is driving each?",
    "Which inspection types have the highest rejection rate, and what findings volume do they generate?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "How many distinct transactions appeared each month?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', event_date) AS month, COUNT(DISTINCT transaction) AS distinct_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.quality_events",
        "GROUP BY 1",
        "ORDER BY 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has highest units affected changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT event_date, MEASURE(max_units_affected) AS max_units_affected",
        "FROM {fqn}.quality_events_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY event_date",
        "LIMIT 10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in total customer complaints?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', kpi_month) AS month, MEASURE(total_customer_complaints) AS total_customer_complaints",
        "FROM {fqn}.quality_kpi_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "Which product line identifiers have the highest total *?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT product_line, SUM(*) AS record_count, SUM(units_affected) AS total_units_affected",
        "FROM {fqn}.quality_events",
        "WHERE capa_status = 'Open'",
        "GROUP BY product_line",
        "ORDER BY total_units_affected DESC",
        "LIMIT 10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total units inspected in this batch over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT inspection_date, SUM(units_inspected) AS total_units_inspected",
        "FROM {fqn}.inspection_records",
        "GROUP BY inspection_date ORDER BY inspection_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has the average capa closure rate percentage changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT kpi_month, AVG(capa_closure_rate_pct) AS avg_capa_closure_rate_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.quality_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY kpi_month ORDER BY kpi_month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has critical event count changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT event_date, MEASURE(critical_event_count) AS critical_event_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.quality_events_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY event_date"
      ]
    }
  ],
